 "query": "I swear the stray cat that hangs out on my apartment building\u2019s back porch has been running a tiny little heist on me all week. I leave a small bowl of kibble out for her every morning before I head out, and for the last three days, I\u2019ve come home to find the bowl completely empty, plus a random little trinket left right next to it like she\u2019s paying me back. Yesterday it was a shiny blue bottle cap, the day before that a super fuzzy dandelion puff that was still perfectly intact, and today it was a tiny plastic dinosaur figurine that looks like it fell out of a kid\u2019s happy meal. I even sat by the window for 20 minutes this morning to watch her after I put the food out, turns out she\u2019s been dragging the bowl over to the bush where her two tiny kittens are hiding, then hunting around the sidewalk for little \u201cgifts\u201d to leave while they eat.\nHey there, I\u2019m browsing the women\u2019s fashion hoodies & sweatshirts section right now and I need a detachable sleeve one for sure, in the coffee color I\u2019ve been eyeing forever. I only want to grab one that\u2019s a good price, nothing that feels like a total ripoff for casual loungewear. I\u2019m not super fussy about extra frills or random graphics, just something cozy I can throw on for class and coffee runs this fall. Can you pull up the options that fit what I\u2019m looking for? I don\u2019t want to scroll through hundreds of listings that don\u2019t match what I have in mind.",
